msgstr "The songs of Mega CD discs are audio tracks on the disc, not in the chip."

msgid "Las dos consolas se han descompasado (fotograma %d): lo que veis ya no es lo mismo. Salid y volved a empezar."
msgstr "The two consoles went out of sync (frame %d): you no longer see the same thing. Leave and start again."

msgid ""
"Las notas del YM2612 y del PSG suenan con instrumentos General MIDI del SoundFont\n"
"elegido, como en un módulo SC-55. Las voces y la batería digital (el DAC) siguen siendo las del juego.\n"
"Cada sonido FM recibe un instrumento por reglas, que se cambia a mano en el\n"
"Editor de instrumentos."
msgstr ""
"The YM2612 and PSG notes play on General MIDI instruments from the chosen\n"
"SoundFont, as on an SC-55 module. Voices and digital drums (the DAC) stay the game's own.\n"
"Each FM sound gets an instrument by rules, which can be changed by hand in the\n"
"Instrument editor."

